        <detaileddescription>
<para>This applies an filter on a given value where the outcome of the filter&apos;s full expression will be either a boolean true or false. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>filter</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
